lakes like this. Lake Magadi in the Rift Valley of East Africa is I think just

00:45:33.880 --> 00:45:40.800
about the most hostile environment that I know for land animals let alone fish.

00:45:51.760 --> 00:45:57.640
It's a lake not of water but of solid soda and potash solidified by the

