00:51:28.480 --> 00:51:43.240
And now they're totally spent. They don't even have enough energy to heal their

00:51:43.240 --> 00:51:48.640
battered wounded bodies. Their scales fall off and the once powerful muscles

00:51:48.640 --> 00:51:58.000
the flesh dwindles and shrivels and they die. All of them. Not a single one of the

00:51:58.000 --> 00:52:02.800
millions of fish which fought their way up this river ever goes back to the sea.

00:52:02.800 --> 00:52:07.800
But their eggs remain and they'll stay here throughout the winter safe in the

00:52:07.800 --> 00:52:13.760
