00:52:13.760 --> 00:52:20.040
to the ocean. There they will feed and grow until at the appointed time two

00:52:20.040 --> 00:52:24.360
years hence exactly as far as these pink salmon are concerned the fully grown

00:52:24.360 --> 00:52:29.280
fish will once again beat its way powerfully up river to the place where it

00:52:29.280 --> 00:52:31.640
was born.

00:52:48.320 --> 00:52:53.440
The salmon is the master both of saltwater and fresh but one part of the

00:52:53.440 --> 00:52:59.840
world is closed even to it the land and yet a few fish can survive even there

00:52:59.840 --> 00:53:05.920
for a short time. The walking catfish travels overland using bony fins and a

00:53:05.920 --> 00:53:11.800
